... (Se ... Tak)","مِنَ الظُّلُمَاتِ إِلَى النُّورِ / مِنَ السَّمَاءِ إِلَى الْأَرْضِ","Andheron se roshni ki taraf / Aasman se zameen tak"]]}},{"id":"sec_s2l6_concept","type":"rule_paragraph","data":{"text":"<div class=\"lesson-concept-svg\" style=\"margin:14px 0;padding:12px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0f172a,#1e293b);border:1px solid #334155;\">\n<svg viewBox=\"0 0 760 190\" width=\"100%\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n  <defs>\n    <linearGradient id=\"u123grad\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"1\">\n      <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#0d9488\"/>\n      <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#0284c7\"/>\n    </linearGradient>\n  </defs>\n  <rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"744\" height=\"174\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#0f172a\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <rect x=\"22\" y=\"20\" width=\"150\" height=\"26\" rx=\"13\" fill=\"url(#u123grad)\"/>\n  <text x=\"97\" y=\"37\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">UNIT 2 • LESSON 6</text>\n  <text x=\"188\" y=\"38\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"700\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">Harf-e-Jarr 'Ilaa' (Ki taraf / Tak): الْكِتَابُ ← إِلَى الْكِتَابِ (Page 62–63)</text>\n  <rect x=\"24\" y=\"58\" width=\"220\" height=\"68\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#1e293b\" stroke=\"#475569\"/>\n  <text x=\"134\" y=\"98\" fill=\"#fbbf24\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" direction=\"rtl\" font-family=\"Traditional Arabic,Amiri,serif\">الْكِتَابُ ، الصِّرَاطُ</text>\n  <circle cx=\"288\" cy=\"92\" r=\"22\" fill=\"#0d9488\"/>\n  <text x=\"288\" y=\"98\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">Harf-e-Jarr (إِلَىٰ + ـِ)</text>\n  <rect x=\"332\" y=\"58\" width=\"402\" height=\"68\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#0f292a\" stroke=\"#14b8a6\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n  <text x=\"533\" y=\"98\" fill=\"#34d399\" font-size=\"23\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" direction=\"rtl\" font-family=\"Traditional Arabic,Amiri,serif\">إِلَى الْكِتَابِ ، إِلَى الصِّرَاطِ</text>\n  <text x=\"26\" y=\"150\" fill=\"#cbd5e1\" font-size=\"12.5\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">• الْكِتَابُ ، الصِّرَاطُ (Kitaab, Raasta) se إِلَى الْكِتَابِ ، إِلَى الصِّرَاطِ (Kitaab ki taraf, Raaste ki taraf) banta hai.</text>\n  <text x=\"26\" y=\"170\" fill=\"#94a3b8\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">• Huroof-e-Jarr, Inna, Laa, Illaa, Kaana aur Yaa Qur'ani jumlon ki buniyadi chabiyan hain.</text>\n</svg>\n</div>\n**Qaa'ida (Pages 62–63):** **`إِلَىٰ`** ka matlab **'ki taraf / tak'** hai. Iske baad aane wale ism ke neeche **Zair (`ـِ / ـٍ`)** aati hai: `إِلَى الْكِتَابِ` (Kitaab ki taraf), `مِنَ الظُّلُمَاتِ إِلَى النُّورِ` (andheron se roshni ki taraf)."}},{"id":"sec_s2l6_r2","type":"rule_paragraph","data":{"text":"Upar ki misalon se wazeh hai ke (إِلَىٰ) ke maani 'ki taraf' hain, aur iske baad aane wale lafz ke aakhir mein aam taur par zer (kasrah) aati hai. (إِلَىٰ) aur iske baad wala lafz mil kar ek murakkab (phrase) bante hain aur ek saath tarjuma kiye jaate hain. Yeh lafz Quran Majeed mein bohot martaba aaya hai."}},{"id":"sec_s2l6_r3","type":"rule_paragraph","data":{"text":"Ab aap in Qur'ani fiqron ko khud samajh aur tarjuma kar sakte hain:","hinglish_text":"Ab aap mein Qur'ani fiqron ko khud samajh aur tarjuma kar sakte hain:"}},{"id":"sec_s2l6_g4","type":"two_col_numbered_list","data":{"is_numbered":false,"items":[{"id":"s2l6_g4_w1","arabic":"إِلَى الظُّلُمَاتِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">إِلَى</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">الظُّلُمَاتِ</span>","hinglish":"Andheron ki taraf","translations":{"en":"Towards the darknesses","ur":"اندھیروں کی طرف","hi":"अंधेरों की तरफ़"}},{"id":"s2l6_g4_w2","arabic":"إِلَى النُّورِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">إِلَى</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">النُّورِ</span>","hinglish":"Roshni ki taraf","translations":{"en":"Towards the light","ur":"روشنی کی طرف","hi":"रोशनी की तरफ़"}},{"id":"s2l6_g4_w3","arabic":"إِلَى الرَّسُولِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">إِلَى</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">الرَّسُولِ</span>","hinglish":"Rasool ki taraf","translations":{"en":"To the Messenger","ur":"رسول کی طرف","hi":"रसूल की तरफ़"}},{"id":"s2l6_g4_w4","arabic":"إِلَى اللَّهِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">إِلَى</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">اللَّهِ</span>","hinglish":"Allah ki taraf","translations":{"en":"To Allah","ur":"اللہ کی طرف","hi":"अल्लाह की तरफ़"}},{"id":"s2l6_g4_w5","arabic":"إِلَى الْجَنَّةِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">إِلَى</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">الْجَنَّةِ</span>","hinglish":"Jannat ki taraf","translations":{"en":"To Paradise","ur":"جنت کی طرف","hi":"जन्नत की तरफ़"}},{"id":"s2l6_g4_w6","arabic":"إِلَى اللَّيْلِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">إِلَى</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">اللَّيْلِ</span>","hinglish":"Raat tak","translations":{"en":"Until the night","ur":"رات تک","hi":"रात तक"}},{"id":"s2l6_g4_w7","arabic":"إِلَى الْحَقِّ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">إِلَى</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">الْحَقِّ</span>","hinglish":"Haq ki taraf","translations":{"en":"To the truth","ur":"حق کی طرف","hi":"हक़ की तरफ़"}},{"id":"s2l6_g4_w8","arabic":"إِلَى الْحَجِّ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">إِلَى</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">الْحَجِّ</span>","hinglish":"Hajj ki taraf","translations":{"en":"To the Hajj (pilgrimage)","ur":"حج کی طرف","hi":"हज्ज की तरफ़"}},{"id":"s2l6_g4_w9","arabic":"إِلَى الْمَغْفِرَةِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">إِلَى</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">الْمَغْفِرَةِ</span>","hinglish":"Maghfirat ki taraf","translations":{"en":"To forgiveness","ur":"مغفرت کی طرف","hi":"मग़फ़िरत की तरफ़"}},{"id":"s2l6_g4_w10","arabic":"إِلَى النَّجَاةِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">إِلَى</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">النَّجَاةِ</span>","hinglish":"Najaat ki taraf","translations":{"en":"To salvation","ur":"نجات کی طرف","hi":"नजात की तरफ़"}},{"id":"s2l6_g4_w11","arabic":"إِلَى الْإِيمَانِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">إِلَى</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">الْإِيمَانِ</span>","hinglish":"Imaan ki taraf","translations":{"en":"To faith","ur":"ایمان کی طرف","hi":"ईमान की तरफ़"}},{"id":"s2l6_g4_w12","arabic":"إِلَى الْإِسْلَامِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">إِلَى</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">الْإِسْلَامِ</span>","hinglish":"Islam ki taraf","translations":{"en":"To Islam","ur":"اسلام کی طرف","hi":"इस्लाम की तरफ़"}},{"id":"s2l6_g4_w13","arabic":"إِلَى الدَّاعِي","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">إِلَى</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">الدَّاعِي</span>","hinglish":"Pukaarne wale ki taraf","translations":{"en":"Towards the caller","ur":"پکارنے والے کی طرف","hi":"पुकारने वाले की तरफ़"}},{"id":"s2l6_g4_w14","arabic":"إِلَى الْخَيْرِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">إِلَى</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">الْخَيْرِ</span>","hinglish":"Bhalai ki taraf","translations":{"en":"To goodness","ur":"بھلائی کی طرف","hi":"भलाई की तरफ़"}},{"id":"s2l6_g4_w15","arabic":"إِلَى الطَّاغُوتِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">إِلَى</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">الطَّاغُوتِ</span>","hinglish":"Taaghoot ki taraf","translations":{"en":"To Taghut (false deities)","ur":"طاغوت کی طرف","hi":"ताग़ूत की तरफ़"}},{"id":"s2l6_g4_w16","arabic":"إِلَى الرَّحْمَنِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">إِلَى</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">الرَّحْمَنِ</span>","hinglish":"Rahmaan ki taraf","translations":{"en":"To the Most Merciful (Ar-Rahman)","ur":"رحمٰن کی طرف","hi":"रहमान की तरफ़"}},{"id":"s2l6_g4_w17","arabic":"إِلَى النَّاسِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">إِلَى</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">النَّاسِ</span>","hinglish":"Logon ki taraf","translations":{"en":"To the people","ur":"لوگوں کی طرف","hi":"लोगों की तरफ़"}},{"id":"s2l6_g4_w18","arabic":"إِلَى الْمَوْتِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">إِلَى</span> <span class=\"arabic