abic-root\">طَعَام</span><span class=\"nonroot\">ٍ</span>","hinglish":"Kisi khaane ki taraf","translations":{"en":"To a meal","ur":"کسی کھانے کی طرف","hi":"किसी खाने की तरफ़"}},{"id":"s2l6_g6_w7","arabic":"إِلَى صِرَاطٍ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">إِلَى</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">صِرَاط</span><span class=\"nonroot\">ٍ</span>","hinglish":"Kisi raaste ki taraf","translations":{"en":"To a path","ur":"کسی راستے کی طرف","hi":"किसी रास्ते की तरफ़"}},{"id":"s2l6_g6_w8","arabic":"إِلَى مَغْفِرَةٍ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">إِلَى</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">مَغْفِرَة</span><span class=\"nonroot\">ٍ</span>","hinglish":"Kisi maghfirat ki taraf","translations":{"en":"To forgiveness","ur":"کسی مغفرت کی طرف","hi":"किसी मग़फ़िरत की तरफ़"}},{"id":"s2l6_g6_w9","arabic":"إِلَى خُرُوجٍ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">إِلَى</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">خُرُوج</span><span class=\"nonroot\">ٍ</span>","hinglish":"Kisi nikalne ki taraf","translations":{"en":"To an exit / way out","ur":"کسی نکلنے (کے راستے) کی طرف","hi":"किसी निकलने (के रास्ते) की तरफ़"}},{"id":"s2l6_g6_w10","arabic":"إِلَى فِئَةٍ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">إِلَى</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">فِئَة</span><span class=\"nonroot\">ٍ</span>","hinglish":"Kisi jamaat ki taraf","translations":{"en":"To a company / party","ur":"کسی جماعت کی طرف","hi":"किसी जमाअत की तरफ़"}},{"id":"s2l6_g6_w11","arabic":"إِلَى بَلَدٍ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">إِلَى</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">بَلَد</span><span class=\"nonroot\">ٍ</span>","hinglish":"Kisi shehar ki taraf","translations":{"en":"To a land / city","ur":"کسی شہر / بستی کی طرف","hi":"किसी शहर / बस्ती की तरफ़"}},{"id":"s2l6_g6_w12","arabic":"إِلَى كَلِمَةٍ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">إِلَى</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">كَلِمَة</span><span class=\"nonroot\">ٍ</span>","hinglish":"Kisi baat ki taraf","translations":{"en":"To a word / common term","ur":"کسی بات / کلمے کی طرف