िस्सलाम) और इस्माईल (अलैहिस्सलाम) की तरफ़"}},{"id":"s2l6_g8_w2","arabic":"إِلَى اللَّهِ وَالرَّسُولِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">إِلَى</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">اللَّهِ </span><span class=\"nonroot\">وَ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">الرَّسُولِ</span>","hinglish":"Allah aur Rasool ki taraf","translations":{"en":"To Allah and the Messenger","ur":"اللہ اور رسول کی طرف","hi":"अल्लाह और रसूल की तरफ़"},"ref":"4:59"},{"id":"s2l6_g8_w3","arabic":"إِلَى فِرْعَوْنَ وَهَامَانَ وَقَارُونَ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">إِلَى</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">فِرْعَوْنَ </span><span class=\"nonroot\">وَ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">هَامَانَ </span><span class=\"nonroot\">وَ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">قَارُونَ</span>","hinglish":"Fir'awn, Haman aur Qaroon ki taraf","translations":{"en":"To Pharaoh, Haman, and Korah (Qarun)","ur":"فرعون، ہامان اور قارون کی طرف","hi":"फ़िरौन, हामान और क़ारून की तरफ़"},"ref":"40:24"},{"id":"s2l6_g8_w4","arabic":"إِلَى الْجَنَّةِ وَالْمَغْفِرَةِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">إِلَى</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">الْجَنَّةِ </span><span class=\"nonroot\">وَ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">الْمَغْفِرَةِ</span>","hinglish":"Jannat aur maghfirat ki taraf","translations":{"en":"To Paradise and forgiveness","ur":"جنت اور مغفرت کی طرف","hi":"जन्नत और मग़फ़िरत की तरफ़"},"ref":"2:221"},{"id":"s2l6_g8_w5","arabic":"إِلَى إِبْرَاهِيمَ وَإِسْمَاعِيلَ وَإِسْحَاقَ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">إِلَى</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">إِبْرَاهِيمَ </span><span class=\"nonroot\">وَ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">إِسْمَاعِيلَ </span><span class=\"nonroot\">وَ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">إِسْحَاقَ</span>","hinglish":"Ibrahim (Alaihis Salam), Ismail (Alaihis Salam) aur iss'haaq (Alaihis Salam) ki taraf","translations":{"en":"To Abraham, Ishmael, and Isaac (peace be upon them)","ur":"ابراہیم (علیہ السلام)، اسماعیل (علیہ السلام) اور اسحاق (علیہ السلام) کی طرف","hi":"इब्राहीम (अलैहिस्सलाम), इस्माईल (अलैहिस्सलाम) और इस्हाक़ (अलैहिस्सलाम) की तरफ़"}},{"id":"s2l6_g8_w6","arabic":"إِلَى الْحَقِّ وَإِلَى طَرِيقٍ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">إِلَى</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">الْحَقِّ </span><span class=\"nonroot\">وَإِلَى</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">طَرِيق</span><span class=\"nonroot\">ٍ</span>","hinglish":"Haq ki taraf aur ek raste ki taraf","translations":{"en":"Towards the truth and towards a path","ur":"حق کی طرف اور (سیدھے) راستے کی طرف","hi":"हक़ की तरफ़ और (सीधे) रास्ते की तरफ़"},"ref":"46:30"},{"id":"s2l6_g8_w7","arabic":"إِلَى إِبْرَاهِيمَ وَإِسْمَاعِيلَ وَإِسْحَاقَ وَيَعْقُوبَ وَالْأَسْبَاطِ وَعِيسَى وَأَيُّوبَ وَيُونُسَ وَهَارُونَ وَسُلَيْمَانَ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">إِلَى</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">إِبْرَاهِيمَ </span><span class=\"nonroot\">وَ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">إِسْمَاعِيلَ </span><span class=\"nonroot\">وَ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">إِسْحَاقَ </span><span class=\"nonroot\">وَ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">يَعْقُوبَ </span><span class=\"nonroot\">وَ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">الْأَسْبَاطِ </span><span class=\"nonroot\">وَ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">عِيسَى </span><span class=\"nonroot\">وَ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">أَيُّوبَ </span><span class=\"nonroot\">وَ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">يُونُسَ </span><span class=\"nonroot\">وَ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">هَارُونَ </span><span class=\"nonroot\">وَ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">سُلَيْمَانَ</span>","hinglish":"Ibrahim (Alaihis Salam), Ismail (Alaihis Salam), iss'haaq (Alaihis Salam), Yaqoob (Alaihis Salam), unki aulaad, Isa (Alaihis Salam), Ayyub (Alaihis Salam), Yunus (Alaihis Salam), Haroon (Alaihis Salam) aur Sulaiman (Alaihis Salam) ki taraf","translations":{"en":"To Abraham, Ishmael, Isaac, Jacob, the Descendants, Jesus, Job, Jonah, Aaron, and Solomon (peace be upon them)","ur":"ابراہیم، اسماعیل، اسحاق، یعقوب، ان کی اولاد (اسباط)، عیسیٰ، ایوب، یونس، ہارون اور سلیمان (علیہم السلام) کی طرف","hi":"इब्राहीम, इस्माईल, इस्हाक़, याक़ूब, उनकी औलाद (अस्बात), ईसा, अय्यूब, यूनुस, हारून और सुलैमान (अलैहिमुस्सलाम) की तरफ़"},"ref":"4:163"}]}},{"id":"sec_s2l6_r9","type":"rule_paragraph","data":{"text":"Ab aap darj zail Quranic fiqron ko aasaani se khud samajh aur tarjuma kar sakte hain:"}},{"id":"sec_s2l6_g10","type":"two_col_numbered_list","data":{"is_numbered":false,"items":[{"id":"s2l6_g10_w1","arabic":"مِنَ السَّمَاءِ إِلَى الْأَرْضِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">مِنَ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">السَّمَاءِ </span><span class=\"nonroot\">إِلَى</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">الْأَرْضِ</span>","hinglish":"Aasmaan se zameen ki taraf","translations":{"en":"From the heaven to the earth","ur":"آسمان سے زمین کی طرف","hi":"आसमान से ज़मीन की तरफ़"},"ref":"32:5"},{"id":"s2l6_g10_w2","arabic":"مِنَ الظُّلُمَاتِ إِلَى النُّورِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">مِنَ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">الظُّلُمَاتِ </span><span class=\"nonroot\">إِلَى</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">النُّورِ</span>","hinglish":"Andheron se roshni ki taraf","translations":{"en":"From darknesses into light","ur":"اندھیروں سے روشنی کی طرف","hi":"अंधेरों से रोशनी की तरफ़"}},{"id":"s2l6_g10_w3","arabic":"مِنَ النُّورِ إِلَى الظُّلُمَاتِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">مِنَ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">النُّورِ </span><span class=\"nonroot\">إِلَى</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">الظُّلُمَاتِ</span>","hinglish":"Roshni se andheron ki taraf","translations":{"en":"From light into darknesses","ur":"روشنی سے اندھیروں کی طرف","hi":"रोशनी से अंधेरों की तरफ़"},"ref":"2:257"}],"cols":3}},{"id":"sec_s2l6_g11","type":"grace_box","data":{"text":"Do alfaaz [التَّهْلُكَةِ] aur [الدَّاعِي] par chokor box banaya gaya hai. Kyun? Kyunki yeh naye alfaaz hain aur iss tarah khaas taur par wazeh kiye gaye hain. Agar aap naye alfaaz jaldi yaad karna chahte hain toh unhein isi tarah highlight karein taake baar baar dhyan jaye aur jaldi yaad ho sakein."}},{"id":"sec_s2l6_vlbl","type":"section_label","data":{"text":"Exercise — إِلَىٰ se Banne wali Qur'ani Aayaat (Numbered 1–6)"}},{"id":"sec_s2l6_v","type":"two_col_numbered_list","data":{"is_numbered":true,"items":[{"id":"s2l6_v_s1","sentence_number":1,"arabic":"وَإِلَى اللَّهِ الْمَصِيرُ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">وَإِلَى</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">اللَّهِ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">الْمَصِيرُ</span>","hinglish":"Aur Allah hi ki taraf laut kar jaana hai","translations":{"en":"Toward Allah","ur":"اللہ کی طرف","hi":"अल्लाह की तरफ़"}},{"id":"s2l6_v_s2","sentence_number":2,"arabic":"إِنَّ إِلَىٰ رَبِّكَ الرُّجْعَىٰ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">إِنَّ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">إِلَىٰ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">رَبِّكَ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">الرُّجْعَىٰ</span>","hinglish":"Beshak aapke Rabb hi ki taraf waapsi hai","translations":{"ur":"رسول کی طرف","en":"Toward the Messenger","hi":"रसूल की तरफ़"},"ref":"96:8"},{"id":"s2l6_v_s3","sentence_number":3,"arabic":"وَأَنَّ إِلَىٰ رَبِّكَ الْمُنْتَهَىٰ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">وَأَنَّ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">إِلَىٰ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">رَبِّكَ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">الْ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">مُنْتَهَىٰ</span>","hinglish":"Aur yeh ke aapke Rabb hi ki taraf aakhri intiha hai","translations":{"ur":"حق کی طرف","en":"Toward the truth","hi":"हक़ की तरफ़"},"ref":"53:42"},{"id":"s2l6_v_s4","sentence_number":4,"arabic":"اللَّهُ وَلِيُّ الَّذِينَ آمَنُوا يُخْرِجُهُمْ مِنَ الظُّلُمَاتِ إِلَى النُّورِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">اللَّهُ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">وَلِيُّ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">الَّذِينَ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">آمَن</span><span class=\"nonroot\">ُوا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">يُخْرِج</span><span class=\"nonroot\">ُهُمْ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">مِنَ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">الظُّلُم</span><span class=\"nonroot\">َاتِ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">إِلَى</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">النُّورِ</span>","hinglish":"Allah imaan walon ka dost hai, woh unhein andheron se roshni ki taraf nikalta hai","translations":{"ur":"جنت کی طرف","en":"Toward Paradise","hi":"जन्नत की तरफ़"},"ref":"2:257"},{"id":"s2l6_v_s5","sentence_number":5,"arabic":"وَأَنْزَلْنَا إِلَيْكَ الذِّكْرَ لِتُبَيِّنَ لِلنَّاسِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">وَأَنْزَل</span><span class=\"nonroot\">ْنَا</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">إِلَيْكَ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">الذِّكْرَ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">لِ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">تُبَيِّنَ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">لِ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">لنَّاسِ</span>","hinglish":"Aur hamne aapki taraf Zikr (Qur'an) naazil kiya taake aap logon ke liye wazih karein","translations":{"ur":"آگ کی طرف","en":"Toward the Fire","hi":"आग की तरफ़"},"ref":"16:44"},{"id":"s2l6_v_s6","sentence_number":6,"arabic":"فَفِرُّوا إِلَى اللَّهِ إِنِّي لَكُمْ مِنْهُ نَذِيرٌ مُبِينٌ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">فَفِرُّوا</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">إِلَى</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">اللَّهِ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">إِنِّي</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">لَكُمْ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">مِنْهُ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">نَذِيرٌ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">مُبِينٌ</span>","hinglish":"Pas Allah ki taraf daudo, beshak main tumhare liye Uski taraf se khula darane wala hoon","translations":{"ur":"اندھیروں سے روشنی کی طرف","en":"From the darknesses into the light","hi":"अंधेरों से रोशनी की तरफ़"},"ref":"51:50"}]}},{"type":"section_label","data":{"text":"Exercise Q-1 (Page 63): Darj zail Qur'ani aayaat mein (إِلَىٰ) wale murakkab ko pehchaniye:","title":"Exercise Q-1 (Page 63)"}},{"type":"two_col_numbered_list","data":{"cols":3,"is_numbered":true,"items":[{"id":"s2l6_ex1_s1","arabic":"﴿يَدْعُونَ إِلَى الْخَيْرِ﴾","arabic_markup":"﴿<span class=\"nonroot\">يَدْعُونَ إِلَى</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">الْخَيْرِ</span>﴾","hinglish":"Woh bhalai ki taraf bulate hain","translations":{"en":"They invite to all that is good","ur":"وہ بھلائی کی طرف بلاتے ہیں","hi":"वे भलाई की तरफ़ बुलाते हैं"},"sentence_number":1,"displayOrder":1,"ref":"3:104"},{"id":"s2l6_ex1_s2","arabic":"﴿أُولَٰئِكَ يَدْعُونَ إِلَى النَّارِ﴾","arabic_markup":"﴿<span class=\"nonroot\">أُولَٰئِكَ يَدْعُونَ إِلَى</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">النَّارِ</span>﴾","hinglish":"Woh log aag ki taraf bulate hain","translations":{"en":"Those invite to the Fire","ur":"وہ لوگ آگ کی طرف بلاتے ہیں","hi":"वे लोग आग की तरफ़ बुलाते हैं"},"sentence_number":2,"displayOrder":2,"ref":"2:221"},{"id":"s2l6_ex1_s3","arabic":"﴿وَاللَّهُ يَدْعُو إِلَى الْجَنَّةِ وَالْمَغْفِرَةِ﴾","arabic_markup":"﴿<span class=\"nonroot\">وَ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">اللَّهُ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">يَدْعُو إِلَى</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">الْجَنَّةِ وَالْمَغْفِرَةِ</span>﴾","hinglish":"Aur Allah Jannat aur maghfirat ki taraf bulata hai","translations":{"en":"And Allah invites to Paradise and to forgiveness","ur":"اور اللہ جنت اور مغفرت کی طرف بلاتا ہے","hi":"और अल्लाह जन्नत और मग़फ़िरत की तरफ़ बुलाता है"},"sentence_number":3,"displayOrder":3,"ref":"2:221"},{"id":"s2l6_ex1_s4","arabic":"﴿كَمَا أَوْحَيْنَا إِلَىٰ نُوحٍ﴾","arabic_markup":"﴿<span class=\"nonroot\">كَمَا أَوْحَيْنَا إِلَىٰ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">نُوحٍ</span>﴾","hinglish":"Jaise hamne Nuh (A.S.) ki taraf wahi bheji","translations":{"en":"Just as We revealed to Noah","ur":"جیسے ہم نے نوح (علیہ السلام) کی طرف وحی بھیجی","hi":"जैसे हमने नूह (अलैहिस्सलाम) की तरफ़ वही भेजी"},"sentence_number":4,"displayOrder":4,"ref":"4:163"},{"id":"s2l6_ex1_s5","arabic":"﴿وَكَلِمَتُهُ أَلْقَاهَا إِلَىٰ مَرْيَمَ﴾","arabic_markup":"﴿<span class=\"nonroot\">وَ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">كَلِمَتُهُ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">أَلْقَاهَا إِلَىٰ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">مَرْيَمَ</span>﴾","hinglish":"Aur Uska kalima jo Usne Maryam ki taraf daala","translations":{"en":"And His word which He directed to Mary","ur":"اور اس کا کلمہ جو اس نے مریم کی طرف ڈالا","hi":"और उसका कलिमा जो उसने मरयम की तरफ़ डाला"},"sentence_number":5,"displayOrder":5,"ref":"4:171"},{"id":"s2l6_ex1_s6","arabic":"﴿فَأَوْحَيْنَا إِلَىٰ مُوسَىٰ﴾","arabic_markup":"﴿<span class=\"nonroot\">فَأَوْحَيْنَا إِلَىٰ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">مُوسَىٰ</span>﴾","hinglish":"Toh hamne Musa (A.S.) ki taraf wahi bheji","translations":{"en":"So We inspired to Moses","ur":"تو ہم نے موسیٰ (علیہ السلام) کی طرف وحی بھیجی","hi":"तो हमने मूसा (अलैहिस्सलाम) की तरफ़ वही भेजी"},"sentence_number":6,"displayOrder":6,"ref":"26:63"},{"id":"s2l6_ex1_s7","arabic":"﴿وَرُدُّوا إِلَى اللَّهِ﴾","arabic_markup":"﴿<span class=\"nonroot\">وَرُدُّوا إِلَى</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">اللَّهِ</span>﴾","hinglish":"Aur woh Allah ki taraf lautaaye gaye","translations":{"en":"And they are returned to Allah","ur":"اور وہ اللہ کی طرف لوٹائے گئے","hi":"और वे अल्लाह की तरफ़ लौटाए गए"},"sentence_number":7,"displayOrder":7,"ref":"10:30"},{"id":"s2l6_ex1_s8","arabic":"﴿مَنْ يَهْدِي إِلَى الْحَقِّ﴾","arabic_markup":"﴿<span class=\"nonroot\">مَنْ يَهْدِي إِلَى</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">الْحَقِّ</span>﴾","hinglish":"Jo haq ki taraf rasta dikhata hai","translations":{"en":"He who guides to the truth","ur":"جو حق کی طرف راستہ دکھاتا ہے","hi":"जो हक़ की तरफ़ रास्ता दिखाता है"},"sentence_number":8,"displayOrder":8,"ref":"10:35"},{"id":"s2l6_ex1_s9","arabic":"﴿أَدْعُو إِلَى اللَّهِ عَلَىٰ بَصِيرَةٍ﴾","arabic_markup":"﴿<span class=\"nonroot\">أَدْعُو إِلَى</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">اللَّهِ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">عَلَىٰ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">بَصِيرَةٍ</span>﴾","hinglish":"Main baseerat par reh kar Allah ki taraf bulata hoon","translations":{"en":"I invite to Allah with insight","ur":"میں بصیرت پر رہ کر اللہ کی طرف بلاتا ہوں","hi":"मैं बसीरत पर रहकर अल्लाह की तरफ़ बुलाता हूँ"},"sentence_number":9,"displayOrder":9,"ref":"12:108"}]}},{"type":"section_label","data":{"text":"Exercise Q-2 (Page 63): Darj zail Qur'ani aayaat mein (إِلَىٰ) aur uske baad aane wale lafz par ghaur karein:","title":"Exercise Q-2 (Page 63)"}},{"type":"two_col_numbered_list","data":{"cols":2,"is_numbered":true,"items":[{"id":"s2l6_ex2_s1","arabic":"﴿أَفَلَا يَنْظُرُونَ إِلَى الْإِبِلِ كَيْفَ خُلِقَتْ . وَإِلَى السَّمَاءِ كَيْفَ رُفِعَتْ . وَإِلَى الْجِبَالِ كَيْفَ نُصِبَتْ . وَإِلَى الْأَرْضِ كَيْفَ سُطِحَتْ﴾","arabic_markup":"﴿<span class=\"nonroot\">أَفَلَا يَنْظُرُونَ إِلَى</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">الْإِبِلِ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">كَيْفَ خُلِقَتْ . وَإِلَى</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">السَّمَاءِ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">كَيْفَ رُفِعَتْ . وَإِلَى</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">الْجِبَالِ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">كَيْفَ نُصِبَتْ . وَإِلَى</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">الْأَرْضِ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">كَيْفَ سُطِحَتْ</span>﴾","hinglish":"Kya woh oont ki taraf nahin dekhte ke kaise paida kiya gaya, aur aasmaan ki taraf ke kaise buland kiya gaya, aur pahaadon ki taraf ke kaise gaade gaye, aur zameen ki taraf ke kaise bichhayi gayi?","translations":{"en":"Do they not look at the camels — how they are created? And at the sky — how it is raised? And at the mountains — how they are erected? And at the earth — how it is spread out?","ur":"کیا وہ اونٹ کی طرف نہیں دیکھتے کہ کیسے پیدا کیا گیا، اور آسمان کی طرف کہ کیسے بلند کیا گیا، اور پہاڑوں کی طرف کہ کیسے گاڑے گئے، اور زمین کی طرف کہ کیسے بچھائی گئی؟","hi":"क्या वे ऊँट की तरफ़ नहीं देखते कि कैसे पैदा किया गया, और आसमान की तरफ़ कि कैसे बुलंद किया गया, और पहाड़ों की तरफ़ कि कैसे गाड़े गए, और ज़मीन की तरफ़ कि कैसे बिछाई गई?"},"sentence_number":1,"displayOrder":1,"full_width":true,"ref":"88:17-20"},{"id":"s2l6_ex2_s2","arabic":"﴿أَدْعُوكُمْ إِلَى النَّجَاةِ وَتَدْعُونَنِي إِلَى النَّارِ﴾","arabic_markup":"﴿<span class=\"nonroot\">أَدْعُوكُمْ إِلَى</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">النَّجَاةِ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">وَتَدْعُونَنِي إِلَى</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">النَّارِ</span>﴾","hinglish":"Main tumhein najaat ki taraf bulata hoon aur tum mujhe aag ki taraf bulate ho","translations":{"en":"I invite you to salvation while you invite me to the Fire","ur":"میں تمہیں نجات کی طرف بلاتا ہوں اور تم مجھے آگ کی طرف بلاتے ہو","hi":"मैं तुम्हें नजात की तरफ़ बुलाता हूँ और तुम मुझे आग की तरफ़ बुलाते हो"},"sentence_number":2,"displayOrder":2,"ref":"40:41"}]}}]}}